{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o076a","title":"姜维攻狄道王经洮西战败守城","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o076a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"姜维攻狄道王经洮西战败守城","evidence":["shaodi-e-o076a-q"]},{"id":"houzhu-a-d927692f89f0","label":"《后主传》正文","text":"夏，复率诸军出狄道，与魏雍州刺史王经战于洮西，大破之。经退保狄道城；维却住钟题〖14〗。","evidence":["houzhu-q-O065"]},{"id":"jfj-a-o042a","label":"正文 · 延熙十八年","text":"姜维夏侯霸洮西破王经并围狄道","evidence":["jfj-q0159"]},{"id":"huanchen-a-5c96711f6252c892d8eb","label":"正文","text":"经故关战不利渡洮大败保狄道","evidence":["huanchen-q-9e754a9a399d9671f0b1"]},{"id":"dengzhang-a-6290b6e0b8c92db79c11","label":"正文","text":"姜维狄道大破王经","evidence":["dengzhang-q-c878b5ebddd5713257f4"]},{"id":"dengzhang-a-a5eb5bc6055f43e621f3","label":"正文","text":"姜维围王经于狄道不克","evidence":["dengzhang-q-a342a50fc1fc938d0d0d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0050","role":"进攻","evidence":["shaodi-e-o076a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0079","role":"败守","evidence":["shaodi-e-o076a-q"]},{"person":"guanzhang-p0049","role":"进攻","evidence":["jfj-q0159"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0046","role":"以经不坚据狄道必有他变、并遣五营在前率诸军继之","evidence":["huanchen-q-9e754a9a399d9671f0b1"]}],"place":{"text":"洮西","evidence":["shaodi-q-o076"]},"time":{"year":255,"label":"辛亥","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y255","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o072","basis":"辛亥"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o076a-q","shaodi-q-o072","shaodi-q-b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o076a-q","source_order":[4,337,"O076a"],"order":1152}],"persons":[{"id":"guanzhang-p0049","name":"夏侯霸","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0046","name":"陈泰","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0050","name":"姜维","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0079","name":"王经","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dengzhang-q-a342a50fc1fc938d0d0d","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-9173784ede3ac5762e8f","layer":"original","quote":"维竟围经于狄道，城不能克","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":48,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":111,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-c878b5ebddd5713257f4","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-9173784ede3ac5762e8f","layer":"original","quote":"维至狄道，大破魏雍州刺史王经，经众死于洮水者以万计","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":48,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-O065","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-c3b5a23f5d44e3c1300b","layer":"original","quote":"夏，复率诸军出狄道，与魏雍州刺史王经战于洮西，大破之。经退保狄道城；维却住钟题〖14〗。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":123,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-9e754a9a399d9671f0b1","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-4595f049a60fc3e9a254","layer":"original","quote":"会经所统诸军于故关与贼战不利〖13〗，经辄渡洮〖14〗。泰以经不坚据狄道，必有他变；并遣五营在前，泰率诸军继之。经已与维战，大败；以万余人还保狄道城，余皆奔散。维乘胜围狄道","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":237,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0159","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-5af1c31721bbfd739fd3","layer":"original","quote":"后十八年〖3〗，复与车骑将军夏侯霸等，俱出狄道，大破魏雍州刺史王经于洮西。经众死者数万人。经退保狄道城。维围之。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o076a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-f3fdf2376549fb1e7ad9","layer":"original","quote":"八月，辛亥〖25〗，蜀卫将军姜维寇狄道〖26〗。雍州刺史王经与战洮西〖27〗。经大败，还保狄道城。辛未〖28〗，以长水校尉邓艾行安西将军〖29〗，与征西将军陈泰并力拒维〖30〗。戊辰〖31〗，复遣太尉司马孚为后继。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f","layer":"modern","quote":"〖6〗二年：正元二年（公元 255）。乙丑：旧历十二日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-96103ace1e11ae4131ba","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o072","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4b9070779d1c209c6814","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月，乙丑〖6〗，镇东将军毌丘俭、扬州刺史文钦反。（戊戌）〔戊寅〕〖7〗，大将军司马景王征之。癸未〖8〗，车骑将军郭淮薨。闰月，己亥〖9〗，破钦于乐嘉〖10〗；钦遁走，遂奔吴。甲辰〖11〗，安风淮津都尉斩俭〖12〗，传首京都。﹝一﹞壬子〖13〗，复特赦淮南士民诸为俭、钦所诖误者〖14〗。以镇南将军诸葛诞为镇东大将军〖15〗。司马景王薨于许昌。二月，丁巳〖16〗，以卫将军司马文王为大将军〖17〗，录尚书事。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":207,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o076","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-f3fdf2376549fb1e7ad9","layer":"original","quote":"八月，辛亥〖25〗，蜀卫将军姜维寇狄道〖26〗。雍州刺史王经与战洮西〖27〗。经大败，还保狄道城。辛未〖28〗，以长水校尉邓艾行安西将军〖29〗，与征西将军陈泰并力拒维〖30〗。戊辰〖31〗，复遣太尉司马孚为后继。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
